---
TDL: 0.1
Shell: 0.1
Name: Tray_Menu
---

# The menu of a tray item (Tray Module > The Menu): one level of it, as the content of a Popup.
# The Tray opens the Popup `Tray_Menu` with the item's menu tree in `caller.data`; a row with a
# submenu opens the Popup `Tray_Menu_2` (and its rows `Tray_Menu_3`) beside it, which read the same
# data and the row's `Id`. Write the three in the shell file, each with this module as its content:
#   Popup Tray_Menu   { Attach: BOTTOM, Gap: 4, Max_Height: 600
#       Style { Background: $color.surface_raised, Corner_Radius: 8 }
#       Children { Tray_Menu { } } }
#   Popup Tray_Menu_2 { Max_Height: 600, Style { ... }, Children { Tray_Menu { Level: 2 } } }
#   Popup Tray_Menu_3 { Max_Height: 600, Style { ... }, Children { Tray_Menu { Level: 3 } } }
# A row is a MenuItem: its label (an underscore, the mnemonic, is taken out), an icon (a theme icon
# or the entry's own picture; a check mark or a radio button for a toggle entry), a key hint, an
# arrow for a submenu, a rule for a separator. A disabled row takes no click. A click on a row sends
# the application `Event(id, "clicked")` and closes the whole menu (a click on a row that opens a
# submenu opens it and sends nothing); the tree is not kept after that.
# A menu longer than the Popup's `Max_Height` scrolls.
Module {
    Params {
        # 1: the menu itself; 2 and 3: the submenu of the row that opened this Popup
        Level { Type: number, Default: 1 }
    }
    FlexBox {
        Name: Root
        Flex: VERTICAL
        Children {
            Menu {
                Label: {{ caller.data.title }}
                Children {
                    For e In {{ caller.data.menus["0"] if params.Level == 1 else caller.data.menus[caller.use.params.Id] }} Key {{ e.id }} {
                        MenuItem {
                            Text: {{ e.text }}
                            Icon: {{ e.icon }}
                            Shortcut_Text: {{ e.shortcut }}
                            Separator: {{ e.separator }}
                            Submenu: {{ e.submenu }}
                            Id: {{ e.id }}
                            Label: {{ e.label }}
                            Enabled: {{ e.enabled }}
                            On_Click {
                                Action: pick
                                id: {{ e.id }}
                                submenu: {{ e.submenu }}
                                service: {{ caller.data.service }}
                                path: {{ caller.data.path }}
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
